    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/e1bca1f0e79d4c7bc34205f553ba6e88.poster.avif?t=1727873889\" width=800 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/e1bca1f0e79d4c7bc34205f553ba6e88.webm?t=1727873889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/e1bca1f0e79d4c7bc34205f553ba6e88.mp4?t=1727873889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/dfce88064903acb2dfe3256438855aef.poster.avif?t=1727873889\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/dfce88064903acb2dfe3256438855aef.webm?t=1727873889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/dfce88064903acb2dfe3256438855aef.mp4?t=1727873889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle of Arachnidia  </strong>is an addictive top-down arcade shooter, a modern interpretation of classic arcade games. The game is set in a battle mech battles with hordes of spider-robot warriors. Your task is to defend your base by exterminating all enemies, making your way through all sorts of tactical solutions, improving your robot and using various power-ups that will help in the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/3cc1e19cc41e72fbcf2f8b0aa100d943.avif?t=1727873889\" width=620 height=161 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > a lot of different levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > different levels with unique abilities of the enemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > a system of easily obtaining bonuses that help repel attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > the level raising system of the individual fighting robot makes it more destructive<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/e3562d78161448330353ae5b8ea10831.avif?t=1727873889\" width=620 height=161 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>The game was completely developed by one person - Volodymyr Krysenko, as a tribute to classic arcade games.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/e1bca1f0e79d4c7bc34205f553ba6e88.poster.avif?t=1727873889\" width=800 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/e1bca1f0e79d4c7bc34205f553ba6e88.webm?t=1727873889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/e1bca1f0e79d4c7bc34205f553ba6e88.mp4?t=1727873889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/dfce88064903acb2dfe3256438855aef.poster.avif?t=1727873889\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/dfce88064903acb2dfe3256438855aef.webm?t=1727873889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/dfce88064903acb2dfe3256438855aef.mp4?t=1727873889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle of Arachnidia  </strong>is an addictive top-down arcade shooter, a modern interpretation of classic arcade games. The game is set in a battle mech battles with hordes of spider-robot warriors. Your task is to defend your base by exterminating all enemies, making your way through all sorts of tactical solutions, improving your robot and using various power-ups that will help in the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/3cc1e19cc41e72fbcf2f8b0aa100d943.avif?t=1727873889\" width=620 height=161 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > a lot of different levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > different levels with unique abilities of the enemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > a system of easily obtaining bonuses that help repel attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > the level raising system of the individual fighting robot makes it more destructive<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063680/extras/e3562d78161448330353ae5b8ea10831.avif?t=1727873889\" width=620 height=161 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>The game was completely developed by one person - Volodymyr Krysenko, as a tribute to classic arcade games.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Battle of Arachnidia is a fast-paced top-down shooter in which you fight back against hordes of arachnid robots. Protect your base by destroying all enemies by coming up with different tactics, improving your robot and using different help bonuses.",
